{"name":"a-name-under-a-label-runs-on-its-value","query":":Box |~~ A parcel. ~~| (::kind | holds :LengthNotPositiveError |~~ A box has a length. ~~| ~(get /0 | gt 0)) | :Box/length |~~ The length. ~~| ~(get /0) | :Box/put |~~ The same box with another weight inside. ~~| (::fn | takes :weight |~~ The weight to put inside. ~~| /0 | holds :weight/NotANumberError |~~ The weight is a number. ~~| ~(type | eq ::number) | impl ~(within ~(take 1 | append weight))) | :Box/args |~~ The args of the call. ~~| (::fn | takes :values |~~ The values of the call. ~~| ~(it) | impl ~(args)) | ::Box[4 2] | length","expect":"4"}
